  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of Alaska Medicaid Rybix ODT (tramadol HCl) approval criteria. Clinical attestations require manual verification. The source adult indication is paired with the explicit approval age threshold of 17 years.",
    "Available strength: 50 mg orally disintegrating tablets.",
    "Authorization (notes only): coverage may be approved up to 6 months.",
    "Dispensing (notes only): 30-day supply; quantity limit 8 doses/day. If co-administered with other tramadol products (IR, ER, or tramadol/acetaminophen), reduce the dispensing limit accordingly so total tramadol does not exceed 400 mg/day. Example: tramadol ER 300 mg/day plus ODT up to 2 doses/day totals 400 mg/day.",
